│ Help · Linear                                                                                                        │
│ The project's Linear board: your personal Linear connection, and the board this project is linked to. Task ownership │
│ comes from the coordinator's issue assignment; selecting a row never claims or completes work. In Intake (n), only a │
│ needs-agent label, delegation or mention a trusted person makes in Linear itself counts; signals made through        │
│ ClawBridge run as the app and are never trusted. Project status (p) reads each Linear project's status through the   │
│ server's ClawBridge app, which costs the project's Linear budget; a project owner or lead, in a TUI opened without a │
│ session, sets one after the server's preview. Shared views (v) lists the board's teams' Linear views with your       │
│ Linear connection, read-only; a project owner writes them in their own terminal with clawbridge linear view create,  │
│ update and delete.                                                                                                   │
